Transformations: names normalized to kebab-case; R row names retained as model
and state columns; factors rendered as labels with levels in metadata; R NA
rendered as the dedicated missing sentinel; Titanic expanded without dropping
zero cells; AirPassengers expanded to year/month/passenger count; standardized
lars x and y retained; UCI bezdekIris.data selected; Wine class moved last;
breast cancer ID and diagnosis moved after measurements. Source row order and
numeric precision retained. Source versions, archive and normalized SHA-256
hashes, variable descriptions, and dataset-specific notes are in the immutable
registry (datasets/private/registry.rktd). Upstream documentation is retained in
datasets/provenance; full data license texts are in datasets/licenses.
